# tunnel - one loop, slowly mutating - the Hood pocket
bpm 128
swing 8
humanize kick 10
humanize hat 10
humanize oh 10
humanize clap 10
humanize snare 10
humanize perc 10
humanize bass 10
humanize stab 10
kick x...x...x...x...
hat x....x....x.....
gain hat 0.5
perc .x..x..x..x...x.
tune perc 350
bass a1! f1 . a1 . . . f1 g1! . a1 . . . . a2
filter bass lp 500 res 0.7
sidechain bass 0.6
